### Calc DOLLAR

#### formats with default 2 decimals and thousands grouping

- Verify: formats with default 2 decimals and thousands grouping
   - Expected: _eval("=DOLLAR(1234.567)") equals `$1,234.57`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: formats with default 2 decimals and thousands grouping")
expect(_eval("=DOLLAR(1234.567)")).to_equal("$1,234.57")
```

</details>

